<p>Hi <%= @member.name %>,</p>

<p>Thank you — we've recorded your availability for <strong><%= @group.name %></strong>. We're glad you're taking part.</p>

<p>Here's what you shared:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Topic:</strong> <%= @topic&.name || "—" %></li>
  <% @window_labels.each do |label| %>
    <li><strong>Window:</strong> <%= label %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<% if @can_edit && @response_url.present? %>
  <p>
    You can change your answers until the round closes:
    <a href="<%= @response_url %>">Update my availability</a>
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>When matching runs, we'll introduce you by email if we find someone who chose the same topic and the same window. We hope it's a conversation you both enjoy.</p>

<p>— WE Match</p>
